// 中文维护注释：本文件是 stage154 visibility publication bridge first-slice
// runtime owner。
// Owner: runtime renderer internal bridge from stage153 guarded executor bridge
// to the existing visibility publication denial envelope assets。
// Truth: 本阶段新增 visibility publication positive predicate map / fixture，
// 但 stage153 runtime admission 未满足时不发布 visibility truth。
// Stop-line: visibility publication、renderer_state_write 与 runtime_state_write
// 必须保持 false，不扩 native bridge / public API。
package cjgui

